# MapTiler API key — https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
#
# Optional. With no key the maps fall back to Esri satellite, which is fine for
# z0-z18 but silently serves blank grey tiles past z18. MapTiler pushes satellite
# imagery to z20+, so set this if you want to zoom in on villages.
#
# This key is shipped to the browser on purpose (MapTiler keys are public client
# keys). Lock it down in the MapTiler dashboard instead:
#   - Allowed HTTP origins: http://localhost:3000
#     Add your deployed origin too, or leave the field empty for any origin.
#   - Allowed user-agent: leave empty unless you want a substring match.
#
# Free tier is 100k requests/month, non-commercial use, and the service pauses
# until the next month if you exceed it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_KEY=